              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wan giwa mom otye i akina jo a dok cen, eka te rwenyo oko odoco; wan otye i akina jo ame tye kede iyee, eka te gwoko kwogi.",
          "type": "text",
